 "remarks": "Welcome to this sophisticated townhouse style condo, one of only eight residences in an association designed by Rich Granoff. Soaring 9+ foot ceilings, rich hardwood floors throughout, and elegant crown molding showcase true craftsmanship at every turn.The main level offers a generous, open flow from the kitchen to the dining area and into the inviting living room with fireplace and direct access to a private covered terrace. Upstairs, the primary suite features a fireplace, private terrace, dual walk in closets, and a spa inspired bathroom. A second bedroom offers custom built ins, a walk in closet, and a full en suite bath. The lower level adds a generous family room, private one car garage with ample storage, and mudroom. A true neighborhood feel, yet close to Greenwich's shopping, dining, and recreation.",
